---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Terms & Conditions | Findable Home"
    description="Read the terms governing your use of Findable Home, including household advice, product information, affiliate links, intellectual property, and liability."
>
    <main class="min-h-screen bg-base-200/40">
        <header class="border-b border-base-300 bg-base-100">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
                <div class="max-w-3xl">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">
                        OUR POLICIES
                    </span>
                    <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-base-content sm:text-5xl">
                        Terms &amp; Conditions
                    </h1>
                    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-base-content/70">
                        The guidelines that apply when you explore Findable Home,
                        use our content, and follow recommendations to third-party websites.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-base-content/70">
                        <span class="rounded-lg bg-base-200 px-3 py-2">
                            Effective: October 10, 2026
                        </span>
                        <span class="rounded-lg bg-base-200 px-3 py-2">
                            Updated: October 10, 2026
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-8 h-1 w-20 rounded-full bg-secondary"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 items-start gap-8 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[240px_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
            <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-6">
                <nav aria-label="Terms and conditions contents" class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-5 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="text-base font-bold">On this page</h2>
                    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#agreement">1. Agreement</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#about">2. About Findable Home</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#use">3. Website use</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#information">4. Information and accuracy</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#household">5. Household solutions</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#products">6. Products and fit</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#affiliates">7. Affiliate links</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#third-parties">8. Third-party websites</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#intellectual-property">9. Intellectual property</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#communications">10. Communications</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#advice">11. No professional advice</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#availability">12. Website availability</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#liability">13. Warranties and liability</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#indemnification">14. Indemnification</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#changes">15. Changes</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#legal">16. Legal provisions</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#contact">17. Contact</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
            </aside>

            <div class="min-w-0 space-y-5 text-base-content">
                <section id="agreement" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 border-l-4 border-l-primary bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">1. Agreement to These Terms</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Welcome to Findable Home. These Terms &amp; Conditions govern
                        your access to and use of
                        <a href="https://findablehome.me/" class="link link-primary">findablehome.me</a>,
                        including its content, features, and resources.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        In these Terms, "Findable Home," "we," "us," and "our"
                        refer to the Findable Home website and its operator, as
                        applicable. By accessing or using the website, you agree
                        to these Terms and our
                        <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="link link-primary">Privacy Policy</a>,
                        to the extent permitted by applicable law. If you do not
                        agree, please discontinue use of the website.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="about" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">2. About Findable Home</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home publishes practical information about
                        household organization, small-space living, renter-friendly
                        solutions, storage, product research, buying guidance,
                        product comparisons, checklists, guides, and related topics.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Our purpose is to help readers understand everyday
                        household problems and explore realistic ways to make
                        their spaces easier to organize and use. Website content
                        is provided for general informational and educational purposes.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="use" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">3. Permitted Use of the Website</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        You may browse the website, read its content, save
                        information for personal reference, and share links to
                        Findable Home pages in a lawful manner. Sharing must not
                        misrepresent the source or imply an endorsement,
                        sponsorship, or affiliation that does not exist.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">You must not:</p>
                    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-7 marker:text-primary">
                        <li>Use the website in violation of applicable laws or regulations.</li>
                        <li>Interfere with the website's operation, security, or availability.</li>
                        <li>Attempt unauthorized access to systems, accounts, or restricted areas.</li>
                        <li>Introduce malicious code or technology intended to cause harm.</li>
                        <li>Impersonate another person or organization.</li>
                        <li>Copy or exploit website content in a way that violates these Terms or applicable law.</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <section id="information" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">4. Information and Accuracy</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        We work to make Findable Home useful, accurate, practical,
                        and reasonably current. However, content may change, and
                        we cannot guarantee that every item of information will
                        always be complete, accurate, current, or error-free.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Product specifications, dimensions, materials, prices,
                        availability, colors, versions, warranties, retailer
                        policies, return policies, and other details may change
                        without notice.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Before making a purchase or other important decision,
                        verify relevant details directly with the manufacturer,
                        retailer, or other appropriate source.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="household" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">5. Household and Home-Solution Information</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        A household method or recommendation may work well in
                        one setting and be unsuitable in another. Homes, materials,
                        rental restrictions, budgets, measurements, and individual
                        needs differ.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        You are responsible for deciding whether a method,
                        product, storage solution, installation approach, or
                        recommendation is suitable for your circumstances.
                        Follow product instructions and relevant safety guidance.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        For potentially hazardous work involving electrical
                        systems, plumbing, structural changes, heavy loads,
                        heights, chemicals, or fire safety, seek an appropriately
                        qualified professional when necessary. We do not guarantee
                        that a particular recommendation will produce a specific result.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="products" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">6. Product Information, Measurements, and Fit</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Unless expressly stated otherwise, Findable Home does
                        not manufacture the products discussed on the website.
                        Products may be made, sold, shipped, warranted, supported,
                        or returned by third-party companies.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Measurements and fit guidance are informational and are
                        not a substitute for measuring your own space. Before
                        purchasing or installing a product, check its current
                        dimensions, compatibility, installation requirements,
                        safety information, price, availability, warranty, and
                        return policy.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Consider openings, doors, hinges, handles, plumbing,
                        fixtures, clearance, surrounding furniture, and access
                        requirements. You are responsible for confirming that
                        a product is suitable for its intended location.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Findable Home is not responsible for the quality,
                        performance, safety, availability, pricing, fulfillment,
                        shipping, warranty, returns, or customer service of
                        third-party products or services.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="affiliates" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">7. Affiliate Relationships</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Some links on Findable Home may be affiliate links.
                        If you click a qualifying link and complete a qualifying
                        purchase or action, we may receive a commission from
                        the relevant retailer, affiliate network, manufacturer,
                        or commercial partner. Any commission does not ordinarily
                        increase your cost unless otherwise disclosed.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        An affiliate relationship does not automatically mean
                        a product is recommended solely because a commission
                        may be available. We aim to keep recommendations useful
                        and relevant to the household problem being addressed.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Please read our
                        <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="link link-primary">Affiliate Disclosure</a>
                        for further information. Disclosures may also appear
                        near relevant recommendations or links.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="third-parties" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">8. Third-Party Websites and Services</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home may link to retailers, manufacturers,
                        product-discovery platforms, affiliate partners, social
                        platforms, and other third-party websites.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        A link does not necessarily mean we endorse the external
                        website, company, product, or service. We do not control
                        third-party content, accuracy, availability, security,
                        privacy practices, terms, prices, policies, or business
                        practices.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Your interactions with an external website are governed
                        by that website's own terms and policies. Review them
                        before providing information or making a purchase.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Findable Home may display third-party advertising in
                        the future. As of the effective date of these Terms,
                        Google AdSense advertising is not an active service on
                        the website. If advertising is introduced, the relevant
                        disclosures and policies will be updated as appropriate.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="intellectual-property" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">9. Intellectual Property</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Unless otherwise stated, original content published by
                        Findable Home—including original writing, branding,
                        logos, graphics, illustrations, page designs, layouts,
                        and other original materials—is owned by or appropriately
                        licensed to Findable Home.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        You may use website content for personal, non-commercial
                        purposes and share links to our pages. You may not
                        reproduce, republish, redistribute, sell, license,
                        modify, systematically copy, create commercial derivative
                        works from, or otherwise commercially exploit our
                        original content without prior written permission,
                        except where applicable law permits such use.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Third-party trademarks, product names, logos, images,
                        and other intellectual property remain the property of
                        their respective owners.
                    </p>
                    <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Copyright and Other Concerns</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 leading-7">
                        If you believe content on Findable Home infringes your
                        intellectual-property rights, contact us with sufficient
                        information to identify the material and explain your
                        concern. We may review the report and take appropriate
                        action where warranted.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="communications" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">10. User Communications</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        If you contact Findable Home, you are responsible for
                        ensuring that the information you provide is accurate
                        and that you have the right to provide it. Do not send
                        passwords, financial-account credentials, payment-card
                        numbers, government identification numbers, or other
                        highly sensitive information through ordinary email.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We may retain communications when reasonably necessary
                        to respond, maintain appropriate records, resolve
                        disputes, or meet legal obligations, consistent with
                        our <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="link link-primary">Privacy Policy</a>.
                    </p>
                    <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Email Subscriptions</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 leading-7">
                        Email marketing subscriptions are not currently active
                        on Findable Home as of the effective date of these Terms.
                        If subscriptions are introduced, the information
                        presented at signup and our Privacy Policy will explain
                        the relevant practices and choices. Any future marketing
                        emails will include an appropriate unsubscribe method
                        where required by law.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="advice" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">11. No Professional Advice</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home provides general informational and
                        educational content. Unless expressly stated otherwise,
                        website content does not constitute professional legal,
                        financial, engineering, architectural, construction,
                        electrical, plumbing, medical, or other specialized advice.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Where your circumstances require professional judgment,
                        consult an appropriately qualified professional.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="availability" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">12. Website Availability and Changes</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        We aim to keep Findable Home available and functioning
                        properly, but we cannot guarantee uninterrupted,
                        secure, error-free access or that the website will
                        always be free from harmful components.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We may modify, update, suspend, restrict, or discontinue
                        any part of the website or its content. Articles,
                        features, integrations, and resources may be revised,
                        consolidated, or removed as information and circumstances change.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="liability" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">13. Disclaimer of Warranties and Limitation of Liability</h2>
                    <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Disclaimer of Warranties</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 leading-7">
                        To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law,
                        Findable Home is provided on an "as is" and "as available"
                        basis. We make no express or implied warranties about
                        the website or its content, including warranties of
                        accuracy, completeness, reliability, availability,
                        fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement,
                        except where a warranty cannot legally be excluded.
                    </p>
                    <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Limitation of Liability</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 leading-7">
                        To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law,
                        Findable Home and its operator will not be liable for
                        indirect, incidental, consequential, special, exemplary,
                        or other damages arising from your access to or use of
                        the website, reliance on its content, inability to
                        access it, or interactions with third-party websites,
                        products, services, advertisements, retailers, or
                        affiliate partners.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        This includes, to the extent permitted by law, losses
                        associated with purchasing, installing, using, modifying,
                        or relying on a product, organization method, household
                        solution, or recommendation discussed on the website.
                        Nothing in these Terms excludes or limits a right,
                        warranty, or liability that applicable law does not
                        permit to be excluded or limited.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="indemnification" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">14. Indemnification</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        To the extent permitted by applicable law, you agree
                        to indemnify and hold harmless Findable Home and its
                        operator from claims, liabilities, damages, losses,
                        costs, and expenses arising from your unlawful use
                        of the website, violation of these Terms, violation
                        of another person's rights, or misuse of website
                        content or services.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        This provision does not require you to indemnify
                        Findable Home for matters that cannot lawfully be
                        assigned to you.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="changes" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">15. Changes to These Terms</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        We may update these Terms to reflect changes to
                        Findable Home, its services, business practices,
                        applicable requirements, or other circumstances.
                        The revised version will be published on this page
                        with an updated "Last Updated" date.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Your continued use of the website after updated Terms
                        are published may constitute acceptance of the revised
                        Terms to the extent permitted by applicable law.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="legal" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">16. Governing Law and Other Legal Provisions</h2>
                    <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Governing Law</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 leading-7">
                        These Terms are subject to applicable law. Any
                        governing-law or jurisdiction question must be
                        determined in light of the website operator's actual
                        circumstances and the rights that apply to the visitor.
                        Nothing in these Terms is intended to remove consumer
                        protections that cannot legally be waived or overridden.
                    </p>
                    <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Severability</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 leading-7">
                        If any provision of these Terms is found invalid,
                        unlawful, or unenforceable, the remaining provisions
                        will continue to apply to the maximum extent permitted by law.
                    </p>
                    <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Entire Agreement</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 leading-7">
                        These Terms, together with the Findable Home Privacy
                        Policy and any other policies expressly incorporated
                        into them, govern your use of the website, except where
                        additional terms apply to a particular service or transaction.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="contact" class="scroll-mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="h-1.5 bg-primary"></div>
                    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
                        <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Need clarification?</span>
                        <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">17. Contact Findable Home</h2>
                        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                            If you have questions about these Terms &amp; Conditions,
                            please contact us.
                        </p>
                        <div class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-5">
                            <p class="font-bold">Findable Home</p>
                            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Email us at</p>
                            <a href="mailto:contact@findablehome.me" class="mt-1 inline-block break-all font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4">
                                contact@findablehome.me
                            </a>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-sm">
                                <a href="https://findablehome.me/" class="link link-primary">findablehome.me</a>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <p class="px-1 py-3 text-center text-sm text-base-content/60">
                    Thank you for visiting Findable Home.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>

